        <div class="field__item"><!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC "-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0 Transitional//EN" "http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40/loose.dtd">
<html><body><p>If you need assistance reading these ballots, please contact us at 615-862-8800.</p><h2>2026 Elections</h2><ul><li><a href="/sites/default/files/2026-09/Sample_Ballot_November_3_2026_State_Fed_Gen_Mun_Elections.pdf?ct=1790110765" data-entity-type="media" data-entity-uuid="8786bc6d-b072-445e-ab08-0cb642df88cf" data-entity-substitution="canonical">November 3, 2026 State and Federal General Election, Belle Meade, Forest Hills, Goodlettsville Municipal Elections</a></li><li><a href="/sites/default/files/2026-06/Sample_Ballot_August_6_2026_State_Fed_Prim_Cty_Gen_Oak_Hill.pdf?ct=1781625299" data-entity-type="media" data-entity-uuid="3595e941-d63d-4d32-b11d-b08bd2bcb9ef" data-entity-substitution="canonical">August 6, 2026 State and Federal Primary, County General, Oak Hill Municipal Election</a></li><li><a href="/sites/default/files/2026-03/Sample_Ballot_May_5_2026_County_Primary_Election.pdf?ct=1773790628" data-entity-type="media" data-entity-uuid="809106e9-0e2c-4ee7-8337-f88f229ea5e8" data-entity-substitution="canonical">May 5, 2026 County Primary Election</a></li><li><a href="/sites/default/files/2026-01/Sample_Ballot_March_17_2026_Berry_Hill_Municipal_Election.pdf?ct=1769706118" data-entity-type="media" data-entity-uuid="88212be3-9555-43b6-a7d7-22fc0e2b8765" data-entity-substitution="canonical">March 17, 2026 Berry Hill Municipal Election</a></li></ul><h2>2025 Elections</h2><ul><li><a href="/sites/default/files/2025-10/Sample_Ballot_Dec_2_2025_D7_Special_General.pdf?ct=1760709670" data-entity-type="media" data-entity-uuid="c14ed347-44e0-4c93-b5a1-a6873d814e26" data-entity-substitution="canonical">December 2, 2025 U.S. House of Representatives, District 7 Special General Election</a></li><li><a href="/sites/default/files/2025-08/Sample_Ballot_Oct_7_2025_Special_Primary.pdf?ct=1755640618" data-entity-type="media" data-entity-uuid="1ebc773d-6ce2-4ef7-a90f-f1bef87f1e5a" data-entity-substitution="canonical">October 7, 2025 U.S. House of Representatives, District 7 Special Primary Election</a></li></ul><h2>2024 Elections</h2><ul><li><a class="nt-cke-document-link-instance" href="/sites/default/files/2024-09/Sample_Ballot_November_5_2024_Elections.pdf?ct=1726085007" data-entity-type="media" data-entity-id="164521">November 5, 2024 State and Federal General Election, Belle Meade, Forest Hills, Goodlettsville Municipal Elections, Transit Improvement Program Referendum Election</a></li><li><a class="nt-cke-document-link-instance" href="/sites/default/files/2024-06/Sample_Ballot_August_1_2024_SF_Prim_Cty_Gen_OHill.pdf?ct=1718385980" data-entity-type="media" data-entity-id="157656">August 1, 2024 State and Federal Primary, County General, Oak Hill Municipal Election</a></li><li><a class="nt-cke-document-link-instance" href="/sites/default/files/2024-01/Sample_Ballot_March_5_2024_PPP_Cty_Prim_BHill_Mun.pdf?ct=1706553128" data-entity-type="media" data-entity-id="145926">March 5, 2024 Presidential Preference Primary, County Primary, Berry Hill Municipal Election</a></li></ul><h2>2023 Elections</h2><ul><li><a class="nt-cke-document-link-instance" href="/sites/default/files/2023-08/Sample_Ballot_SEPTEMBER_14_2023_Elections.pdf?ct=1691763550" data-entity-type="media" data-entity-id="133551">September 14, 2023 TN House District 51 Special General Election, Metropolitan Runoff Election</a></li><li><a class="nt-cke-document-link-instance" href="/sites/default/files/2023-06/Sample_Ballot_August_3_2023_Elections.pdf?ct=1687799278" data-entity-type="media" data-entity-id="129741">August 3, 2023 TN House District 51 Special Primary Election, TN House District 52 Special General Election, Metropolitan General Election</a></li><li><a class="nt-cke-document-link-instance" href="/sites/default/files/2023-05/Sample_Ballot_June_15_2023_Special_Primary_Election.pdf?ct=1683665287" data-entity-type="media" data-entity-id="126461">June 15, 2023 TN House District 52 Special Primary Election</a></li></ul><h2>2022 Elections</h2><ul><li><a class="nt-cke-document-link-instance" href="/sites/default/files/2022-09/Sample_Ballot_November_8_2022_State_Federal_Municipal_Elections.pdf?ct=1663342490" data-entity-type="media" data-entity-id="109671">November 8, 2022 State and Federal General Election, Belle Meade, Forest Hills, Goodlettsville Municipal Elections</a></li><li><a class="nt-cke-document-link-instance" href="/sites/default/files/2022-07/Sample_Ballot_August_4_2022_pgs_1-20.pdf?ct=1657054919" data-entity-type="media" data-entity-id="101706">August 4, 2022 State and Federal Primary, County General, Oak Hill Municipal Election</a></li><li><a class="nt-cke-document-link-instance" href="/sites/default/files/2022-04/Sample_Ballots_May_3_2022_County_Primary_Election.pdf?ct=1648819785" data-entity-type="media" data-entity-id="94671">May 3, 2022 County Primary Election</a></li><li><a class="nt-cke-document-link-instance" href="/sites/default/files/2022-01/SAMPLE_BALLOT_Berry_Hill_Election_March_15_2022.pdf?ct=1642712308" data-entity-type="media" data-entity-id="88856">March 15, 2022 Berry Hill Municipal Election</a></li></ul><h2>2020 Elections</h2><ul><li><a href="/departments/elections/document/thu-09/25/2025-209-pm/197626" data-entity-type="media" data-entity-uuid="5adb5f5b-8aed-4576-989f-f2ddac4ffd3a" data-entity-substitution="canonical">November 3, 2020 Presidential and State General Election, School Board District 4 Election, Belle Meade, Forest Hills, Goodlettsville Municipal Elections</a></li><li><a href="/sites/default/files/2025-09/200806-SampleBallot.pdf?ct=1758827375" data-entity-type="media" data-entity-uuid="f49fe862-e0fe-457a-b682-08fec40d6d5d" data-entity-substitution="canonical">August 6, 2020 State and Federal Primary, County General, Oak Hill Municipal Election</a></li><li><a href="/sites/default/files/2025-09/200303-SampleBallot.pdf?ct=1758827362" data-entity-type="media" data-entity-uuid="7f9b8a00-64a1-4809-b16e-3fee5d33ac33" data-entity-substitution="canonical">March 3, 2020 Presidential Preference Primary, County Primary, Berry Hill Municipal Election</a></li></ul><h2>2019 Elections</h2><ul><li><a href="/sites/default/files/2025-09/190912-MetroRunoff.pdf?ct=1758827349" data-entity-type="media" data-entity-uuid="cbb4a892-288c-4302-96ae-fdd99929ab30" data-entity-substitution="canonical">September 12, 2019 Metropolitan General Runoff Election</a></li><li><a href="/sites/default/files/2025-09/190801-MetroGeneral.pdf?ct=1758827334" data-entity-type="media" data-entity-uuid="acb71110-b3b6-4c95-a4d2-1d473823b302" data-entity-substitution="canonical">August 1, 2019 Metropolitan General Election</a></li><li><a href="/sites/default/files/2025-09/190319-District29.pdf?ct=1758827320" data-entity-type="media" data-entity-uuid="73ef4518-a6bc-4515-85a9-ffef962b034f" data-entity-substitution="canonical">March 19, 2019 Special Runoff Election Council District 29</a></li><li><a href="/sites/default/files/2025-09/190212-District19.pdf?ct=1758827309" data-entity-type="media" data-entity-uuid="304081f6-71e2-4afa-a75f-757f9f1acf29" data-entity-substitution="canonical">February 12, 2019 Special Election Council District 29</a></li></ul><h2>2018 Elections</h2><ul><li><a href="/sites/default/files/2025-09/181106-StateFederalGeneralElectionSampleBallot.pdf?ct=1758827285" data-entity-type="media" data-entity-uuid="23179140-eb9e-4874-9b0b-2c46bfda11b6" data-entity-substitution="canonical">November 6, 2018 State and Federal General Election</a></li><li><a href="/sites/default/files/2025-09/180906-ViceMayorRunoffSampleBallot.pdf?ct=1758827269" data-entity-type="media" data-entity-uuid="bc486992-39a6-40e2-a1b5-98cdab2efc0b" data-entity-substitution="canonical">September 6, 2018 Vice Mayor Runoff Election</a></li><li><a href="/sites/default/files/2025-09/180802-StateDemocraticPrimaryElectionSampleBallot.pdf?ct=1758827236" data-entity-type="media" data-entity-uuid="ad67d695-8451-4f64-840d-524224ef8c29" data-entity-substitution="canonical">August 2, 2018 State Democratic Primary Election</a></li><li><a href="/sites/default/files/2025-09/180802-StateRepublicanPrimaryElectionSampleBallot.pdf?ct=1758827252" data-entity-type="media" data-entity-uuid="3c01e771-84f2-4367-8610-bf7c11e0c53d" data-entity-substitution="canonical">August 2, 2018 State Republican Primary Election</a></li><li><a href="/sites/default/files/2025-09/180802-CountyGeneralElectionSampleBallot.pdf?ct=1758827202" data-entity-type="media" data-entity-uuid="22760a52-be9a-48b0-9028-0ef83d1ff2c4" data-entity-substitution="canonical">August 2, 2018 County General Election</a></li><li><a href="/sites/default/files/2025-09/180802-OakHillMunicipalElectionSampleBallot.pdf?ct=1758827221" data-entity-type="media" data-entity-uuid="dee1bdd7-5a7f-48f6-afb4-2e06a6ca14dc" data-entity-substitution="canonical">August 2, 2018 Oak Hill Municipal Election</a></li><li><a href="/sites/default/files/2025-09/180628-District1Runoff.pdf?ct=1758827102" data-entity-type="media" data-entity-uuid="ae5cf1bb-d3c4-48ec-8f8d-407563cf832f" data-entity-substitution="canonical">June 28, 2018 Special Runoff Election, Council District 1</a></li><li><a href="/sites/default/files/2025-09/180524-SpecialMetroGeneral.pdf?ct=1758827063" data-entity-type="media" data-entity-uuid="4236632b-4fef-42ef-94a0-2562cc89ef9b" data-entity-substitution="canonical">May 24, 2018 Special Election Mayor and Council District 1</a></li><li><a href="/sites/default/files/2025-09/180501-RepublicanPrimary.pdf?ct=1758826919" data-entity-type="media" data-entity-uuid="4e95402f-f8a8-4fac-967b-097fc2ef4432" data-entity-substitution="canonical">May 1, 2018 County Republican Primary Election</a></li><li><a href="/sites/default/files/2025-09/180501-DemocraticPrimary.pdf?ct=1758826904" data-entity-type="media" data-entity-uuid="97df04b2-d034-40d6-9a0f-76e59d5236a9" data-entity-substitution="canonical">May 1, 2018 County Democratic Primary Election</a></li><li><a href="/sites/default/files/2025-09/180501-Transit.pdf?ct=1758826936" data-entity-type="media" data-entity-uuid="b73c94cd-2cc1-4597-8622-c2817eccd199" data-entity-substitution="canonical">May 1, 2018 Transit Improvement Program Referendum</a></li><li><a href="/sites/default/files/2025-09/180320-BerryHill.pdf?ct=1758826886" data-entity-type="media" data-entity-uuid="925ccfce-046c-457d-8983-7c1242d720ea" data-entity-substitution="canonical">March 20, 2018 Berry Hill Municipal Election</a></li></ul><h2>2017 Elections</h2><ul><li><a href="/sites/default/files/2025-09/170919.pdf?ct=1758826860" data-entity-type="media" data-entity-uuid="edf4f17e-d8a8-42a9-ae4c-5809b07f407a" data-entity-substitution="canonical">September 19, 2017 Special Runoff Election Council District 33</a></li><li><a href="/sites/default/files/2025-09/170815-District33.pdf?ct=1758826842" data-entity-type="media" data-entity-uuid="5c6fdaba-54ef-40fd-9a2f-9e59e685dbaf" data-entity-substitution="canonical">August 15, 2017 Special Election Council District 33</a></li></ul><h2>2016 Elections</h2><ul><li><a href="/sites/default/files/2025-09/161108_SampleBallot.pdf?ct=1758826827" data-entity-type="media" data-entity-uuid="0afc985a-0907-4994-92b1-a340f7df7712" data-entity-substitution="canonical">November 8, 2016 Presidential and State General Election, Belle Meade, Forest Hills, Goodlettsville Municipal Elections</a></li><li><a href="/sites/default/files/2025-09/160804-RepublicanPage.pdf?ct=1758826800" data-entity-type="media" data-entity-uuid="01eb1853-65ad-46fa-b705-469f3ce2bd17" data-entity-substitution="canonical">August 4, 2016 State Republican Primary Election</a></li><li><a href="/sites/default/files/2025-09/160804-DemocratPage.pdf?ct=1758826782" data-entity-type="media" data-entity-uuid="128e74d7-d315-4e34-a14e-f98df3a6a7be" data-entity-substitution="canonical">August 4, 2016 State Democratic Primary Election</a></li><li><a href="/sites/default/files/2025-09/160804-CountyGeneral.pdf?ct=1758826764" data-entity-type="media" data-entity-uuid="dfcb87b7-c277-4515-af6f-2beb3c565633" data-entity-substitution="canonical">August 4, 2016 County General Election</a></li><li><a href="/sites/default/files/2025-09/160607_OakHill.pdf?ct=1758826750" data-entity-type="media" data-entity-uuid="d0018164-234c-40d4-99a0-914408c47c64" data-entity-substitution="canonical">June 7, 2016 Oak Hill Municipal Election</a></li><li><a href="/sites/default/files/2025-09/SampleBallot_160301.pdf?ct=1758827552" data-entity-type="media" data-entity-uuid="8e1dcbf9-f607-4b18-9abf-d817290de17c" data-entity-substitution="canonical">March 1, 2016 Presidential Preference Primary, County Primary, Berry Hill Municipal Election</a></li></ul><h2>2015 Elections</h2><ul><li><a href="/sites/default/files/2025-09/150910_Runoff.pdf?ct=1758826731" data-entity-type="media" data-entity-uuid="ff8e4406-2d16-4169-ab68-98bcc20e32d5" data-entity-substitution="canonical">September 10, 2015 County Runoff Election</a></li><li><a href="/sites/default/files/2025-09/SampleBallot_150806.pdf?ct=1758827540" data-entity-type="media" data-entity-uuid="195bd843-0973-4ba2-81e5-536a1f41267f" data-entity-substitution="canonical">August 6, 2015 County General Election</a></li></ul><h2>2014 Elections</h2><ul><li><a href="/sites/default/files/2025-09/SampleBallot_141104.pdf?ct=1758827526" data-entity-type="media" data-entity-uuid="60349ba2-c3de-4383-bcf1-f59a0c1522f7" data-entity-substitution="canonical">November 4, 2014 State and Federal General Election</a></li><li><a href="/sites/default/files/2025-09/Aug2014SampleBallot.pdf?ct=1758827402" data-entity-type="media" data-entity-uuid="8047fe7a-441c-485f-87e8-54945ab48588" data-entity-substitution="canonical">August 7, 2014 State Republican Primary, State Democratic Primary, County General Election</a></li><li><a href="/sites/default/files/2025-09/OakHill140610Ballot2.pdf?ct=1758827514" data-entity-type="media" data-entity-uuid="265e0646-2a76-405b-a084-dc11311a1ee2" data-entity-substitution="canonical">June 10, 2014 Oak Hill Municipal Election</a></li><li><a href="/sites/default/files/2025-09/May_6_2014_Primary_REP.pdf?ct=1758827486" data-entity-type="media" data-entity-uuid="de49096a-aa83-449b-b37d-426fefb9d45d" data-entity-substitution="canonical">May 6, 2014 County Republican Primary Election</a></li><li><a href="/sites/default/files/2025-09/May_6_2014_Primary_DEM.pdf?ct=1758827473" data-entity-type="media" data-entity-uuid="6c7f8b4e-eb1f-4d94-bfa5-e888ed21c41c" data-entity-substitution="canonical">May 6, 2014 County Democratic Primary Election</a></li><li><a href="/sites/default/files/2025-09/MARCH-18-2014-BERRY-HILL-SAMPLE-BALLOT.pdf?ct=1758827459" data-entity-type="media" data-entity-uuid="82eadf97-78e3-4a25-b9e6-d966d478d80e" data-entity-substitution="canonical">March 18, 2014 Berry Hill Municipal Election</a></li></ul><h2>2012 Elections</h2><ul><li><a href="/sites/default/files/2025-09/121106_PresGenElection.pdf?ct=1758826704" data-entity-type="media" data-entity-uuid="a9958d15-e46f-4ae2-aa71-714bafdf560d" data-entity-substitution="canonical">November 6, 2012 Presidential and State General Election, Belle Meade, Forest Hills, Goodlettsville Municipal Elections</a></li><li><a href="/sites/default/files/2025-09/120802_StatePrimaryCountyGeneral.pdf?ct=1758826639" data-entity-type="media" data-entity-uuid="107796c9-cfe2-497a-ad74-f9e952cbf30e" data-entity-substitution="canonical">August 2, 2012 State Primary and County General Election</a></li><li><a href="/sites/default/files/2025-09/120306_PresPrimary.pdf?ct=1758826584" data-entity-type="media" data-entity-uuid="7919e4d9-f5da-4ca1-84fa-bf35bc576344" data-entity-substitution="canonical">March 6, 2012 Presidential Preference Primary, County Primary, Berry Hill Municipal Election</a></li></ul></body></html>
